    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5945" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">căchinnātĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				violent laughing</i>, <i>immoderate laughter</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sine ullā suspitione nimiae
					suspitionis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Auct. Her. 3, 14, 25</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ut si ridere concessum sit, vituperetur tamen
					cachinnatio,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Tusc. 4, 31, 66</span></i>
			.</div>
